Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 01:33:30 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] v2: swap chronik-bridge and chronik-cpp to V2 headers and
 outputs

Adapt chronik-bridge and chronik-cpp to 134-byte V2 headers and 3-branch
v7 outputs.

Original-Commit: 1596d2ab0700e636e61df13722aa9706850b8dc7
Original-Patch: v2/016
Split-Concern: whole

Historical compilation prerequisites are tracked separately in daemon/patch-audit;
this provenance-preserving split does not imply standalone build validation.

Candidate-Application-Repair: Retain native Chronik header/output/identity adapters and preserve the previously evidenced unsigned-to-signed fee saturation in the renamed V2 fee bridge paths; no arithmetic fix is reverted by adapter context.

(cherry picked from commit 5cb2d12006aa58fefe0a41e40735e380140aea2c)

